<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Schedule B (Form 5500) Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  td { padding: 4px 0; }
  .header-row td { padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .label { font-weight: normal; }
  .input-field { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; min-width: 50px; text-align: right; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">SCHEDULE B</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">(Form 5500)</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Official Use Only</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">OMB No. 1210-0110</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Actuarial Information</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">This schedule is required to be filed under section 104 of the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, referred to as ERISA, except when attached to Form 5500-EZ and, in all cases, under section 6059(a) of the Internal Revenue Code, referred to as the Code.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;► Attach to Form 5500 or 5500-EZ if applicable.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;► See separate instructions.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">For calendar plan year <span data-field="plan_year_start">{{ plan_year_start }}</span> and ending <span data-field="plan_year_end">{{ plan_year_end }}</span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">► Round off amounts to nearest dollar.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">► Caution: A penalty of $1,000 will be assessed for late filing of this report unless reasonable cause is established.</p>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr class="header-row">
      <td style="width: 10%;">A. Name of plan</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">B</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">C</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">D</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="plan_name">{{ plan_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="plan_type_b">{{ plan_type_b }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="plan_type_c">{{ plan_type_c }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="employer_id_d">{{ employer_id_d }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">E. Type of plan: <span data-field="plan_type_e">{{ plan_type_e }}</span></p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (1)</td>
        <td><span data-field="plan_type_e_1">{{ plan_type_e_1 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (2)</td>
        <td><span data-field="plan_type_e_2">{{ plan_type_e_2 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (3)</td>
        <td><span data-field="plan_type_e_3">{{ plan_type_e_3 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">F</td>
        <td><span data-field="plan_type_e_f">{{ plan_type_e_f }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">Part I Basic Information (To be completed by all plans)</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">1a Enter the actuarial valuation date: <span data-field="valuation_date_1">{{ valuation_date_1 }}</span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">b Assets:</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (1) Current value of assets.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="asset_current_value">{{ asset_current_value }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (2) Actuarial value of assets for funding standard account.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="asset_actuarial_value">{{ asset_actuarial_value }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Statement by Enrolled Actuary (see instructions before signing):</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">To the best of my knowledge, the information supplied in this schedule and on the accompanying schedules, statements, and attachments, if any, is complete and accurate, and in my opinion each assumption, used in combination, represents my best estimate of anticipated experience under the plan. Furthermore, in the case of a plan other than a multiemployer plan, I certify that the assumptions used in this schedule and on the accompanying schedules, statements, and attachments, if any, are reasonable in the case of a multiemployer plan, the assumptions used, result in a total contribution equivalent to that which would be determined if each such assumption were reasonable; in the case of a multiemployer plan, the assumptions used, are reasonable.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Signature of actuary</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Type or print</td>
        <td style="width: 40%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Date <span data-field="signature_date">{{ signature_date }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Schedule B (Form 5500)</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Page 2</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Official Use Only</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">1c Accrued liability for plans using immediate gain methods</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(1) Information for plans using spread gain methods:</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (a) Unfunded liability for methods with bases.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="accrued_liability_a">{{ accrued_liability_a }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (b) Accrued liability under entry age normal method.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="accrued_liability_b">{{ accrued_liability_b }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (c) Normal cost under entry age normal method.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="accrued_liability_c">{{ accrued_liability_c }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">d Information on current liabilities of the plan:</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (1) Amount excluded from current liability attributable to pre-participation service (see instructions).</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="current_liability_1">{{ current_liability_1 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (2) "RPA '94" information:</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="current_liability_2">{{ current_liability_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(a) Current liability.</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (b) Expected increase in current liability due to benefits accruing during the plan year.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="current_liability_b">{{ current_liability_b }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (c) Current liability computed at highest allowable interest rate (see instructions).</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="current_liability_c">{{ current_liability_c }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (d) Expected release from "RPA '94" current liability for the plan year.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="current_liability_d">{{ current_liability_d }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(3) Expected plan disbursements for the plan year.</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (2) Operational information as of beginning of this plan year:</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="operational_info_2">{{ operational_info_2 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (a) Current value of the assets (see instructions).</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="operational_info_2a">{{ operational_info_2a }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (b) "RPA '94" current liability.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="operational_info_2b">{{ operational_info_2b }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(1) No. of Persons</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 25%;"> (1) For retired participants and beneficiaries receiving payments</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="persons_retired">{{ persons_retired }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 25%;"> (2) Vested Benefits</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="persons_vested">{{ persons_vested }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 25%;"> (3) Total Benefits</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="persons_total">{{ persons_total }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 25%;"> (2) For terminated vested participants</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="persons_terminated">{{ persons_terminated }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 25%;"> (3) For active participants</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="persons_active">{{ persons_active }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 25%;"> (4) Total</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="persons_total_4">{{ persons_total_4 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">c. If the percentage resulting from dividing line 2a by line 2b(4), column (3), is less than 70%, enter such percentage <span data-field="percentage_c">{{ percentage_c }}</span> %</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Schedule B (Form 5500)</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Page 3</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Official Use Only</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">3 Contributions made to the plan for the plan year by employer(s) and employees:</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr class="header-row">
        <td style="width: 30%;"> (a) Month-Day-Year</td>
        <td style="width: 35%;"> (b) Amount paid by employer</td>
        <td style="width: 35%;"> (c) Amount paid by employees</td>
      </tr>
      {% for i in range(12) %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="contribution_date_{{ loop.index0 }}">{{ 'MM/DD/YYYY' }}</span></td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="contribution_employer_{{ loop.index0 }}">{{ '0.00' }}</span></td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="contribution_employee_{{ loop.index0 }}">{{ '0.00' }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr>
        <td style="font-weight: bold;">Totals</td>
        <td class="input-field" style="font-weight: bold;"><span data-field="contribution_total_employer">{{ contribution_total_employer }}</span></td>
        <td class="input-field" style="font-weight: bold;"><span data-field="contribution_total_employee">{{ contribution_total_employee }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">4 Quarterly contributions and liquidity shortfall(s):</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">a Plans other than multiemployer plans, enter funded current liability percentage for preceding year (see instructions).</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">b If line 4a is less than 100%, see instructions, and complete the following amount fields as applicable:</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;"> (1) 1st</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="shortfall_1st">{{ shortfall_1st }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 20%;"> (2) 2nd</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="shortfall_2nd">{{ shortfall_2nd }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 20%;"> (3) 3rd</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="shortfall_3rd">{{ shortfall_3rd }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 20%;"> (4) 4th</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="shortfall_4th">{{ shortfall_4th }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">5 Actuarial cost method used as the basis for this plan year's funding standard account computation:</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (a) Attained age normal</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="method_a">{{ method_a }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (b) Entry age normal</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="method_b">{{ method_b }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (c) Accrued benefit (unit credit)</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="method_c">{{ method_c }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (d) Aggregate</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="method_d">{{ method_d }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (e) Frozen initial liability</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="method_e">{{ method_e }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (f) Individual level premium</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="method_f">{{ method_f }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (g) Individual aggregate</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="method_g">{{ method_g }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (h) Other (specify)</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="method_h">{{ method_h }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Schedule B (Form 5500)</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Page 4</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Official Use Only</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">6 Has a change been made in funding method for this plan year?</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">If line i is "Yes," was the change made pursuant to Revenue Procedure 2000-40?</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Yes</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">No</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">If line i is "Yes," and line j is "No," enter the date of the ruling letter (individual or class) approving the change in funding method.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="change_date_yes">{{ change_date_yes }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">N/A</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">7 Checklist of certain actuarial assumptions:</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">a Interest rate for "RPA '94" current liability</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="interest_rate_94">{{ interest_rate_94 }}</span> %</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">b Weighted average retirement age</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="weighted_age">{{ weighted_age }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">c Rates specified in insurance or annuity contracts</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">d Mortality table code for valuation purposes:</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="mortality_code">{{ mortality_code }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">e Valuation liability interest rate</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="valuation_rate">{{ valuation_rate }}</span> %</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">f Expense loading</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">g Annual withdrawal rates:</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Male</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Female</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (1) Age 25</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="withdrawal_male_25">{{ withdrawal_male_25 }}</span> %</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="withdrawal_female_25">{{ withdrawal_female_25 }}</span> %</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (2) Age 40</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="withdrawal_male_40">{{ withdrawal_male_40 }}</span> %</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="withdrawal_female_40">{{ withdrawal_female_40 }}</span> %</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (3) Age 55</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="withdrawal_male_55">{{ withdrawal_male_55 }}</span> %</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="withdrawal_female_55">{{ withdrawal_female_55 }}</span> %</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">h Salary scale</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">i Estimated investment return on actuarial value of assets for the year ending on the valuation date</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="investment_return">{{ investment_return }}</span> %</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (3) Amortization Charge/Credit</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="amortization_charge">{{ amortization_charge }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Schedule B (Form 5500)</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Page 5</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Official Use Only</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">8 Miscellaneous information:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">a If a waiver of a funding deficiency or an extension of an amortization period has been approved for this plan year, enter the date of the ruling letter granting the approval.</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">b If one or more alternative methods or rules (as listed in the instructions) were used for this plan year, enter the appropriate code in accordance with the instructions.</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Yes</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">No</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">c Is the plan required to provide a Schedule of Active Participant Data? (see instructions)</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Yes</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">No</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">d Funding standard account statement for this plan year:</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="funding_statement_d">{{ funding_statement_d }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Charges to funding standard account:</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">a Prior year funding deficiency, if any</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="charge_a">{{ charge_a }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Outstanding Balance</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="charge_outstanding">{{ charge_outstanding }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">b Employer's normal cost for plan year as of valuation date</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="charge_b">{{ charge_b }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">c Amortization charges as of valuation date</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="charge_c">{{ charge_c }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (1) All bases except funding waivers</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="charge_1">{{ charge_1 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (2) Funding waivers</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="charge_2">{{ charge_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">d Interest as applicable on line 9a, 9b, and 9c</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">e Additional interest charge due to late quarterly contributions, if applicable</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="interest_e">{{ interest_e }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">f Adjusted additional funding charge from Part II, line 12q, if applicable...</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="interest_f">{{ interest_f }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">g Total charges. Add lines 9a through 9f.</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">h Prior year credit balance, if any</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="total_charges_g">{{ total_charges_g }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">i Employer contributions. Total from column (b) of line 3</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="total_charges_i">{{ total_charges_i }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Schedule B (Form 5500)</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Page 6</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Official Use Only</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">j Amortization credits</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">k Interest as applicable to end of plan year on lines 9h, 9i, and 9j</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="amortization_credits_j">{{ amortization_credits_j }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">l Full funding limitation (FFL) and credits</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="ffl_l">{{ ffl_l }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (1) ERISA FFL (accrued liability FFL)</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="ffl_1">{{ ffl_1 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (2) "RPA '94" override (90% current liability FFL)</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="ffl_2">{{ ffl_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (3) FFL credit</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="ffl_3">{{ ffl_3 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">m (1) Waived funding deficiency</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="ffl_m1">{{ ffl_m1 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (2) Other credits</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="ffl_m2">{{ ffl_m2 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">n Total credits. Add lines 9h through 9k, 9(3), and 9m(2).</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="total_credits_n">{{ total_credits_n }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">90 Credit balance: If line 9n is greater than line 9g, enter the difference</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">p Funding deficiency: If line 9g is greater than line 9n, enter the difference</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="credit_balance_90">{{ credit_balance_90 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Reconciliation account:</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="reconciliation_account">{{ reconciliation_account }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">q Current year's accumulated reconciliation account:</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (1) Due to additional funding charges</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="reconciliation_q1">{{ reconciliation_q1 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (2) Due to additional interest charges</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="reconciliation_q2">{{ reconciliation_q2 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (3) Due to waived funding deficiencies</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="reconciliation_q3">{{ reconciliation_q3 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (a) Reconciliation outstanding balance as of valuation date</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="reconciliation_a">{{ reconciliation_a }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (b) Reconciliation amount. Line 9c(2) balance minus line 9q(3)(a)</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="reconciliation_b">{{ reconciliation_b }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (4) Total as of valuation date</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="reconciliation_4">{{ reconciliation_4 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Schedule B (Form 5500)</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Page 7</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Official Use Only</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">12 Net charges in funding standard account used to offset the deficit reduction contribution. Enter a negative number if less than zero.</p>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">m Unpredictable contingent event amount:</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="net_charges_m">{{ net_charges_m }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (1) Benefits paid during year attributable to unpredictable contingent event</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="net_charges_m1">{{ net_charges_m1 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (2) Unfunded current liability percentage. Subtract the percentage on line 12d from 100%.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="net_charges_m2">{{ net_charges_m2 }}</span> %</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (3) Enter the product of lines 12m(1) and 12m(2)</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="net_charges_m3">{{ net_charges_m3 }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (4) Amortization of all unpredictable contingent event liabilities</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="net_charges_m4">{{ net_charges_m4 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (5) "RPA '94" additional amount (see instructions)</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="net_charges_m5">{{ net_charges_m5 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (6) Enter the greatest of lines 12m(3), 12m(4), or 12m(5)</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="net_charges_m6">{{ net_charges_m6 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">n Preliminary additional funding charge. Enter the excess of line 12k over line 12i (if any), plus line 12m(6), adjusted to end of year with interest.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="preliminary_charge_n">{{ preliminary_charge_n }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">o Contributions needed to increase current liability percentage to 100% (see instructions)</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="contributions_needed_o">{{ contributions_needed_o }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">p Additional funding charge prior to adjustment: Enter the lesser of line 12n or 12o.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="additional_charge_p">{{ additional_charge_p }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">q Adjusted additional funding charge. <span data-field="adjusted_charge_q">{{ adjusted_charge_q }}</span> % of line 12p.</td>
        <td class="input-field"><span data-field="adjusted_charge_q_value">{{ adjusted_charge_q_value }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>